<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - S.Africa's Autonet headline earnings jump.</title>
<headline>TABLE - S.Africa's Autonet headline earnings jump.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Headline earnings     19.6	  vs 10.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit	23.1	  vs 20.7</p>
<p>    Capital expenditure   84.0	  vs 83.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		  489.0	 vs 431.0</p>
<p>Full name: Autonet</p>
<p>NOTE - Autonet is the passenger and road transportation division of South African transport parastatal Transnet.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
